    "updated_at": "2026-05-17T10:22:24Z",
    "body": "**Update**: This workaround works only until reboot\n\n### case\n- zed version 1.2.6\n- macos\n- old devcontainer.json from VSCode\n- .devcontainer directory is a symlink\n- zed `projects: open dev container` action fails with 'Invalid project' nonsense\n\n### workaround\n- run `projects: initialize devcontainer` action (**it will overwrite your existing devcontainer.json**)\n- close window\n- restore your devcontainer.json\n- run `projects: initialize devcontainer`\n\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
